---
name: reflection
description: >
  A persona's own successful action, recorded as a first-person observation
  memory (backend/cognition.py, remember_outcome). The command verb
  selects the phrasing: arriving somewhere, doing an activity, drinking
  (with a sick variant for contaminated water, #300), idling (if chosen
  as a settled-wait #614), agent-initiated talk_to (with an optional topic,
  #614), studying or eating (#615), or a quoted fallback for any other
  command.
  The memory's importance is chosen in Python (it is data, not text), so
  only the wording lives here.
inputs:
  verb:
    type: string
    description: The command verb -- "travel", "perform", "drink", "boil", "wait", "talk_to", "study", "eat", or anything else.
  person:
    type: string
    description: Who was talked to (used when verb == "talk_to").
  location:
    type: string
    description: The place arrived at (used when verb == "travel").
  activity:
    type: string
    description: What the persona is doing (used when verb == "perform").
  item:
    type: string
    description: What was drunk (verb == "drink") or eaten (verb == "eat").
  sick:
    type: boolean
    description: Whether this drink just sickened the persona (verb == "drink").
  recovered:
    type: boolean
    description: Whether this drink just cured the persona's sickness (verb == "drink", #300).
  topic:
    type: string
    description: What was brought up (verb == "talk_to") or studied (verb == "study"); may be empty.
  minutes:
    type: integer
    description: How many in-game minutes the study took (verb == "study", #615).
  command:
    type: string
    description: The raw command, quoted verbatim in the fallback (any other verb).
sample:
  verb: drink
  location: ""
  activity: ""
  item: cup of murky water
  sick: true
  recovered: false
  command: ""
---
{%- if verb == "travel" -%}
I traveled to {{ location }}.
{%- elif verb == "perform" -%}
I am {{ activity }}.
{%- elif verb == "drink" and sick -%}
I drank the {{ item }} and now I feel terribly sick.
{%- elif verb == "drink" and recovered -%}
I drank the {{ item }}, and the sickness has finally passed -- I feel much better.
{%- elif verb == "drink" -%}
I drank the {{ item }}.
{%- elif verb == "boil" -%}
I boiled the water to make it safe to drink.
{%- elif verb == "wait" -%}
I waited; nothing needed doing.
{%- elif verb == "talk_to" and topic -%}
I went to talk to {{ person }} about {{ topic }}.
{%- elif verb == "talk_to" -%}
I went to talk to {{ person }}.
{%- elif verb == "study" and topic -%}
I studied {{ topic }} for {{ minutes }} minutes.
{%- elif verb == "study" -%}
I studied for {{ minutes }} minutes.
{%- elif verb == "eat" -%}
I ate the {{ item }}.
{%- else -%}
I did "{{ command }}".
{%- endif -%}
